    "title": "Highway Rush",
    "author": "NOVA-16",
    "description": "Race a red sports car down a never-turning highway against seven rivals. Dodge cones and oil, hit green pads, grab mystery cubes for a turbo, a shield or an oil slick, and overtake your way to the front in a two-minute sprint at sunset."
